\ A wrong twin: a brace that leaves its goal open, Lean's unsolved goals
\ (89) at its } (plan row TB2, blocks slice 1; blocks-1-wrong.lean).
\ Lean: theorem w_brace_open (a b : Nat) (h : a = b) (k : b = a) : a = b ∧ b = a := by
\         constructor
\         · exact h
\         · have x : b = a := k
theorem w_brace_open
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b
  a b = explicit: h  b a = explicit: k
  a b = b a = ∧
:= by
  by-constructor
  { ' h by-exact }
  { b a = ' k by-have: x }
end w_brace_open
